{"id":"n31700-1-7","stage":3,"title":"절 · 段","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31700-1-7-1","ko":"이 책에서 일 절은 어떤 내용인가요?","zh":"这本书第一节讲什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책에서","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"第一","explanation":"일：第一","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31528","senseId":"2","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"절은","meaning":"段，节","explanation":"절：段，节；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"절","audio":"/audio/06b2f0759a245417cad4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31700","senseId":"1","lemma":"절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么样的，怎么样的","explanation":"어떤：什么样的，怎么样的","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내용인가요?","meaning":"内容","explanation":"내용：内容；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"내용","audio":"/audio/cb0f24046b508710d631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72573","senseId":"3","lemma":"내용","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"第一","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"31528","definition":"第一次的。","pronunciation":["일"]},{"id":"06b2f0759a245417","term":"절","zh":"段，节","audio":"/audio/06b2f0759a245417cad4.mp3","entryId":"31700","definition":"文章内容分成几段叙述时中的一段。","pronunciation":["절"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"cb0f24046b508710","term":"내용","zh":"内容","audio":"/audio/cb0f24046b508710d631.mp3","entryId":"72573","definition":"言语、文章、画作、电影等的情节；或指想借此传递的信息。","pronunciation":["내ː용"]}],"audio":"/audio/1d2254e386cb11d30cc9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31700-1-7-2","ko":"천지의 창조에대한 이야기입니다.","zh":"讲天地的创造。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"천지의","meaning":"天地","explanation":"천지：天地；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"천지","audio":"/audio/ad9361008cadc72147dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77770","senseId":"1","lemma":"천지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"창조에대한","meaning":"创造，新造；对，对于","explanation":"창조：创造，新造；대하다：对，对于；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"창조","audio":"/audio/0f83fc6041262eb97bad.mp3"},{"term":"대하다","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24902","senseId":"1","lemma":"창조","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"86300","senseId":"3","lemma":"대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이야기입니다.","meaning":"故事","explanation":"이야기：故事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"1","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ad9361008cadc721","term":"천지","zh":"天地","audio":"/audio/ad9361008cadc72147dc.mp3","entryId":"77770","definition":"天和地。","pronunciation":["천지"]},{"id":"0f83fc6041262eb9","term":"창조","zh":"创造，新造","audio":"/audio/0f83fc6041262eb97bad.mp3","entryId":"24902","definition":"首次制作或新建之前没有的东西。","pronunciation":["창ː조"]},{"id":"4033b88da1605ad4","term":"대하다","zh":"对，对于","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3","entryId":"86300","definition":"当作对象或对方。","pronunciation":["대ː하다"]},{"id":"ffe0179e59e74069","term":"이야기","zh":"故事","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3","entryId":"60321","definition":"说或写给别人的关于某个事实、状态、现象、经验、想法等的话或文章。","pronunciation":["이야기"]}],"audio":"/audio/9d0e4308425bb4b42b6b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.69,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31700","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":93,"sequenceScore":2.5167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这本书第一节讲什么？","讲天地的创造。","昨天给的零用钱怎么了？又要钱吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这本书第一节讲什么？","讲天地的创造。","昨天给的零用钱怎么了？又要钱吗？"],"answer":1}]}
